---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Credits"
  description="Development, maintenance, content-review, contribution, and source-attribution credits for Komadrona Review."
>
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">People and attribution</span>
      <h1>Credits</h1>
      <p>Credits are based on actual work performed and consent to be named.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <article class="container prose">
    <h2>Development and maintenance</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Kirch Ivan A. Balite</h3>
      <p>Creator, developer, and maintainer</p>
      <p class="small-print">Independent educational project based in Bohol, Philippines.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Content review</h2>
    <p>
      Qualified content reviewers will be listed only after they have performed a documented review and consented to
      public attribution. A person's name, title, institution, or professional credentials will not be added merely
      because they were asked for informal advice.
    </p>

    <h2>Contributors</h2>
    <p>
      Code, accessibility, research, editing, and correction contributors may be credited after an accepted GitHub
      contribution. Contribution does not imply responsibility for the entire site.
    </p>

    <h2>Source institutions</h2>
    <p>
      PRC, the Professional Regulatory Board of Midwifery, DOH, CHED, WHO, and other publishers are credited through
      citations to their materials. Citation does not mean that an institution reviewed, approved, sponsored, or
      endorsed Komadrona Review.
    </p>

    <h2>Brand ownership</h2>
    <p>
      Government agency names, institutional names, trademarks, seals, and third-party publications remain the property
      of their respective owners. Komadrona Review does not claim ownership over them.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
